{
  "name": "gd-skills",
  "description": "Comprehensive game development plugin for Claude Code - Multi-engine support (Godot, Roblox, Unity, Unreal, Defold, Web) with full game creation from 11 genre templates, plus a depth layer of version-pinned engine reference docs, architecture pattern guides, an entity registry with consistency checks, and session-state persistence. Create complete games (platformer, FPS, survival, horror, RPG, racing, puzzle, tower defense, farming, classic, roguelike) with menus, settings, save/load, audio, and multiplayer.",
